    {
      "label": "核心机制",
      "detail": "在受限 iframe 沙箱中托管自包含 HTML+JS 应用",
      "children": [
        "sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms\" 隔离",
        "注入 CSP 阻止外部 HTTP 请求",
        "无法访问 cookie 与 localStorage"
